<p>BORROWER SUNAMERICA INC</p>
<p>AMT $375 MLN	 COUPON 6.20 PCT   MATURITY 10/31/1999</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.917  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
